      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Please know that it's okay to feel completely lost and overwhelmed by such profound loss. These moments of hitting rock bottom are often where the real strength to begin rebuilding is found. Even in the deepest silence, a tiny seed of possibility remains; perhaps a single new dawn can offer a different kind of beginning. If these feelings become too heavy, please reach out for immediate support.",
